# multi-slot-refs root — exercises decision / activity body refs
library "Root".

concept "Trigger":
- type is Encounter.
- value type is boolean.
- coded from "Trigger Valueset".

terminology "Trigger Valueset":
- valueset is `urn:trigger-vs`.

terminology "Activity Reason Valueset":
- valueset is `urn:reason-vs`.

activity "Refer to Specialist":
- request CPGServiceRequest.
- with "Activity Reason Valueset".

decision "Triage":
- when "Trigger" then recommend activity "Refer to Specialist".
